{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/Delta2.gif?t=1751073732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delta 78: The Passenger </strong>is a pixel art narrative experience set aboard a drifting spaceship. You play as Miller, a crew member who wakes up disoriented and alone \u2014 in a place where everything seems dead... except for something watching from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the silent corridors, investigate old terminals, and uncover what happened to the missing crew. Featuring a choice-based internal monologue system, every interaction might reveal the truth \u2014 or lead to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep story with interactive dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth mechanics and hiding spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark, moody pixel art inspired by classic sci-fi horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive atmosphere with dynamic lighting and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for fans of slow-burning, introspective thrillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you really alone\u2026?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715880?t=1751073732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/95eaf45c95ecf38bdae384e208f2a6c4cf7c782e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751073732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/880bfbf00484cfb3de42e93d6cbf6f25821607cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751073732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/880bfbf0048